      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Voriconazole is an anti-fungal agent active against Aspergillus infection that is used for prophylaxis and curative treatment in lung transplant patients. We present nine cases of painful neuromuscular disorders, an unusual and rare side effect of high-dose voriconazole in association with tacrolimus."},
